---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Affiliate disclosure" description="FTC affiliate disclosure for StackPick Lab.">
  <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-slate-900">Affiliate disclosure</h1>
  <div class="prose-spl mt-6 max-w-3xl">
    <p>
      StackPick Lab participates in affiliate programs. If you click a link to a product we mention and later purchase,
      we may earn a commission at <strong>no additional cost to you</strong>.
    </p>
    <p>
      This site complies with the FTC’s guidelines on endorsements and testimonials. Affiliate relationships are
      disclosed on pages that contain monetized links (near the top) and in the site footer.
    </p>
    <h2>Editorial independence</h2>
    <p>
      Commissions do not determine rankings or “winners.” We state who should skip a tool as clearly as who should buy it.
      Pricing and features change; verify details on the vendor’s site before you purchase.
    </p>
    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>Questions about a partnership or correction: use the contact method listed when the site goes live on stackpicklab.com.</p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
